---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar';
import Footer from '../components/Footer';
import AudioPlayerWidget from '../components/AudioPlayerWidget';
---

<Layout 
	title="Terms of Service - Dino Run Epochs"
	description="Terms of Service and user conduct rules for playing Dino Run Epochs online. Free browser gaming, fair play guidelines, and intellectual property terms."
	canonicalPath="/terms"
>
	<Navbar pathname={Astro.url.pathname} client:load />
	
	<main class="w-full pt-32 pb-20 px-4 md:px-8 max-w-[1000px] mx-auto text-slate-200">
		<header class="mb-12 border-b border-white/10 pb-8">
			<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-sky-500/20 bg-sky-500/5 text-sky-400 text-xs font-['Geist_Mono'] font-medium mb-4">
				USER AGREEMENT
			</div>
			<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-['Chakra_Petch'] uppercase">
				Terms of <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 to-cyan-400">Service</span>
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-3 text-slate-400 text-sm font-['Geist_Mono']">
				Effective Date: August 31, 2026 • Version 1.2
			</p>
		</header>

		<article class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 leading-relaxed font-['Outfit'] text-slate-300 text-base">
			
			<div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 text-sky-200 text-sm leading-relaxed">
				<strong>Welcome to Dino Run Epochs!</strong> By accessing or playing our game at dinorunepochs.com, you agree to comply with and be bound by the following terms and conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use this website.
			</div>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">1. Free Access and License</h2>
				<p>Dino Run Epochs is provided free of charge for personal, non-commercial entertainment purposes. We grant you a revocable, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to access and play the game through web browsers that support modern WebAssembly and HTML5 standards.</p>
				<p>You agree not to reverse engineer, decompile, mirror, or repackage the compiled game assets for sale or distribution on unauthorized third-party domains without express written permission.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">2. User Conduct & Fair Play</h2>
				<p>We strive to maintain an honest, competitive, and enjoyable environment for all players. When interacting with Dino Run Epochs, you agree to avoid:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-slate-300">
					<li>Injecting automated bot scripts, macros, or memory-tampering extensions that artificially alter in-game scores or physics calculations.</li>
					<li>Launching denial-of-service (DoS) attacks, automated scraping, or excessive query flooding against our hosting infrastructure.</li>
					<li>Attempting to bypass, manipulate, or block security controls, CORS headers, or advertising integrity mechanisms.</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">3. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
				<p>All original software code, level art, vector models, soundscapes, and graphic branding in Dino Run Epochs are the intellectual property of Dino Run Epochs Studio. "Chrome Dinosaur" homage elements are recognized as historical inspirations from the open-source Chromium project (BSD-licensed).</p>
				<p>Flutter and Flame are open-source trademarks of Google LLC and the Flame Engine team respectively. Dino Run Epochs is an independent indie production.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
				<p>Dino Run Epochs is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. While we strive for continuous 60FPS availability, we do not warrant that gameplay will be completely uninterrupted, error-free, or compatible with obsolete legacy browser versions.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
				<p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Dino Run Epochs Studio shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your access to or inability to access the game.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
				<p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms of Service at any time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated effective date. Continued use of the website following changes indicates your acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
			</section>

			<section class="space-y-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white font-['Chakra_Petch']">7. Contact Information</h2>
				<p>For questions regarding these Terms of Service, please contact our team:</p>
				<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-white/10 font-['Geist_Mono'] text-sm space-y-1">
					<p><strong class="text-white">Legal & Compliance - Dino Run Epochs Studio</strong></p>
					<p>Email: <a href="mailto:support@dinorunepochs.com" class="text-sky-400 hover:underline">support@dinorunepochs.com</a></p>
					<p>Web: <a href="/contact" class="text-sky-400 hover:underline">dinorunepochs.com/contact</a></p>
				</div>
			</section>

		</article>
	</main>

	<AudioPlayerWidget client:load />
	<Footer client:visible />
</Layout>
